{"2671050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shouldermen", "steam_appid": 2671050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shouldermen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know the devil on your shoulder?  The Shouldermen are those tiny angel and devil doppelgangers that stand on your shoulder giving advice when you are making tough decisions. An evil genius has sparked global chaos by trapping everyone's Shouldermen in secure VR prisons leaving humanity to make decisions at random. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job? Hack into the VR prisons and help the Shouldermen to escape by getting them to say the password out loud. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay and Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dialog Driven Gameplay</strong>: Engage in real-time spoken conversations with the characters to play the game.<br><br><strong>Text Input</strong>: Direct control over what you say.<br><br><strong>Word Puzzles</strong>: How will you coax the Shouldermen into saying the password so they can escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who Will You Become?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shouldermen isn't just about saving the world. It's about discovering who you are. Your journey through this AI generated labyrinth will leave you reflecting on what makes us human long after you've played. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Generative AI</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses high quality voices from Eleven Labs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice recognition is handled by Deepgram.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character dialog is generated using GPT-5 from Open AI.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shouldermen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know the devil on your shoulder?  The Shouldermen are those tiny angel and devil doppelgangers that stand on your shoulder giving advice when you are making tough decisions. An evil genius has sparked global chaos by trapping everyone's Shouldermen in secure VR prisons leaving humanity to make decisions at random. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job? Hack into the VR prisons and help the Shouldermen to escape by getting them to say the password out loud. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay and Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dialog Driven Gameplay</strong>: Engage in real-time spoken conversations with the characters to play the game.<br><br><strong>Text Input</strong>: Direct control over what you say.<br><br><strong>Word Puzzles</strong>: How will you coax the Shouldermen into saying the password so they can escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who Will You Become?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shouldermen isn't just about saving the world. It's about discovering who you are. Your journey through this AI generated labyrinth will leave you reflecting on what makes us human long after you've played. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Generative AI</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses high quality voices from Eleven Labs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice recognition is handled by Deepgram.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character dialog is generated using GPT-5 from Open AI.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Shouldermen is a puzzle game that uses your voice as the controller. Help an angel and a devil escape a virtual reality prison by helping them guess the password. The fate of the world hangs in the balance until they are free to stand on shoulders and guide people towards right and wrong.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“The bad guy is hilarious”<br />\r\n10 – Meesh<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“&quot;What did John Wick use to kill a guy in a bar?&quot; and he FINALLY said pencil. 10/10”<br />\r\n10 – Thomas o Kawaiiness<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“Genuinely surprised at just how fun this game is.”<br />\r\n10 – TheKMan<br />\r\n", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671050/6169216ebee2b28b258c632bba541d6706dfcfa1/header.jpg?t=1772921311", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671050/f3ec7f7fd0ac8fba7bb5520ad975f29588d74942/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772921311", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671050/f3ec7f7fd0ac8fba7bb5520ad975f29588d74942/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772921311", "website": "https://shouldermen.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3 GHz Intel or AMD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia or AMD 4GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 GHz Intel or AMD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX or AMD 12GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Copyright 2025 Outdoor Devs", "developers": ["Outdoor Devs"], "publishers": ["FCF Studios"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 499, "final